# Carlsten Sources

This library will host a set of notebooks and docuemnts used to reate mock 
stellar populations of MW-Host satellite galaxies. This work will focus 
more on looking for evidence (or lack thereof) of star formation. Many 
updates will be ongoing with building and maintaining this library. 


